    (id, base, target) 元组列表，按保存顺序逐项输出固定键序
    id,base,target，端点 null 或 host,port 对象。"""
    canonical = {
        "items": [
            {"id": item_id, "base": endpoint_json(base),
             "target": endpoint_json(target)}
